# platform.rp2350_touch_lcd_154.display

The board's ST7789 panel: 240 by 240, RGB565, on SPI1 with the backlight on
GP13, clocked at 62.5 MHz, the ST7789V2's fastest write cycle of 16 ns, which
the Pico's SPI rounds down to what its divider holds. It owns the wiring and
the panel's porch, power, and gamma settings, and registers the controller as
mm.display.
